          "statement": "For real $x,y$, $|xy|=|x||y|$ and $|x+y|\\le|x|+|y|$. For complex\n$z,w$, $|zw|=|z||w|$, $|z+w|\\le|z|+|w|$, and if $w\\ne0$ then\n$|z/w|=|z|/|w|$.",
