          "statement": "For the homogeneous vector-valued variable-step BDF2 recurrence obtained from [[alg-variable-step-bdf2-with-selected-implicit-branch]] by setting $f=0$, let $\\Delta_n=Y_n-Y_{n-1}\\in\\mathbb R^d$. For every $r_n=h_n/h_{n-1}>0$,\n\n$$\\Delta_{n+1}=q(r_n)\\Delta_n,\\qquad q(r)=\\frac{r^2}{1+2r}.$$\n\nThe multiplier satisfies $q(r)\\le1$ exactly when $0<r\\le1+\\sqrt2$. In particular, if $0<r_n\\le r_*<1+\\sqrt2$ for every step, then $q(r_n)\\le q_*:=r_*^2/(1+2r_*)<1$ uniformly.",
